Package: staysvic
Title: City or Coast? Short-Stay Demand in Melbourne and Regional Victoria
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Devaansh", "Gupta", , "dgup0007@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helps someone thinking about running a short-stay rental compare
    the Melbourne CBD with the Great Ocean Road, the Mornington Peninsula,
    Geelong and other Victorian towns. Bundles cleaned Inside Airbnb listings
    and reviews and Homes Victoria median rents, with functions that measure
    seasonal demand, who operates the listings, and how many booked nights a
    short stay needs to out-earn a normal lease. Includes a Shiny app for
    exploring these questions.
